<title>HONG KONG: Videocon Int'l sets US$35 mln FRN.</title>
<headline>Videocon Int'l sets US$35 mln FRN.</headline>
<dateline>HONG KONG 1997-05-09</dateline>
<text>
<p>Videocon International Ltd's US$35 million floating rate note issue is now in general syndication, bankers said on Friday.</p>
<p>The facility has a final maturity of three years, with no put or call options.</p>
<p>It was priced at par to float at 185 basis points over the six-month London Interbank Offered Rate.</p>
<p>Fees are 75 basis points for lead managers committing US$7 million, 62.5 basis points for co-lead managers committing US$5 million and 50 basis points for managers committing US$2 million.</p>
<p>-- Hong Kong newsroom (852) 2847 4039</p>
</text>
